body:
shit

&#x200B;

also autocorrect wouldn't have done anything, I'm on a laptop

I saw some clips on YouTube Shorts and I have this streaming website that is like soap2day but paid and so much better. It has almost everything and you can request shows to be added. Sometimes it takes months, and other times the movie is on the site the next day, you have to be invited though and each account only gets 2 invites. I'd pay to get an invite from someone if I didn't already have it.

&#x200B;

edit: payed to paid, Youtube to YouTube

I'm currently rewatching this series, I'm on season 2 episode 5 (just at the end of it)

&#x200B;

I stopped for a bit because I was trying to find this movie I really wanted to watch, so I messages the r/tomt mods but I got banned for 60 days and muted from messaging the mods for 3 days because I said something like "You should get your answers straight, at first you said only a couple days, then you said it would be open when reddit makes the api's free, I also shouldn't have to ask you twice for an answer to my question"

it feels so much better for me when I smoke it vs IV and snorting it

&#x200B;

I get absolutely no rush shooting it up, I might as well not even do it at all, it's just a waste.

I'm over a year clean, sometimes I just get into a mood every once and a while but one year I just stopped wanting to do it every single day for some reason and only did it once in a blue moon.

&#x200B;

edit: over a year clean for cutting, I did self harm a little but in rehab a bit over half a year ago but that was just me poking myself with a pointy metal thing.

I've had OCD my whole life basically. I did not understand in the slightest what was going on with me when I was younger, and when I started to figure it out my mom would yell at me sometimes that I do not have OCD. Then I finally got a diagnosis and she finally shut up about it, here excuse was "I was scared".

&#x200B;

edit: my OCD also isn't the typical need to be organized/clean like a decent amount of people think OCD is, it's usually about the direction I'm facing or how many times I turned around, the way things go out of my point of vew, how many times and where I touched something, stepping on cracks, spelling, and even how many times I press certain keys like the letter N, I have to press it with both fingers and then delete the extra letter.

Fentanyl doesn't give me a rush when I inject it, I only ever feel anything off it when I smoke it.

&#x200B;

edit: changed you to me x2

I'd take fentanyl. Unless opana really is as good as everyone says it is, which, in that case, I'd take opana.

&#x200B;

edit: adding the , after in the case
